Total Funds Removed by Heather:
The cumulative amount attributed to Heather’s depletion of offset accounts and utilisation of available credit is $391,090.76.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 1:43 PM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1468143719067943076/Funds_Removed_By_Heather_As_of_March_25_2024.pdf?ex=6a2e55e3&amp;is=6a2d0463&amp;hm=693e34cac8cb552d07d22da3b189f08a42c420ad21866fe005fb08d31dc0574a&amp;"> Funds_Removed_By_Heather_As_of_March_25_2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>436.1 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
