class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><div class=chatlog__short-timestamp title="Sunday, April 12, 2026 11:24 AM">11:24 AM</div></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787485955068025/Screenshot_20260412_104045_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e572f&amp;is=6a2d05af&amp;hm=e6fc65110e3faa20adfa6b6cf86d24f1de1f646f3ad160577c18a226c1b25a32&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787485955068025/Screenshot_20260412_104045_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e572f&amp;is=6a2d05af&amp;hm=e6fc65110e3faa20adfa6b6cf86d24f1de1f646f3ad160577c18a226c1b25a32&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260412_104045_Revolut.jpg (404.41 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div><div id=chatlog__message-container-1492787507375374468 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1492787507375374468><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><div class=chatlog__short-timestamp title="Sunday, April 12, 2026 11:24 AM">11:24 AM</div></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787502271037581/Screenshot_20260331_133617_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5733&amp;is=6a2d05b3&amp;hm=8087149950afb3fc49969db1f2b10ce05ac876fbeda970db4134a8e1299f0bbf&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787502271037581/Screenshot_20260331_133617_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5733&amp;is=6a2d05b3&amp;hm=8087149950afb3fc49969db1f2b10ce05ac876fbeda970db4134a8e1299f0bbf&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260331_133617_Revolut.jpg (244.46 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787502627688488/Screenshot_20260401_090512_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5733&amp;is=6a2d05b3&a