dapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787506012225648/Screenshot_20260401_091424_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5734&amp;is=6a2d05b4&amp;hm=cb65695cbd113df6f6faf670e4307d44c07422b0755f82dd9a266ee8073ead1a&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260401_091424_Revolut.jpg (149.09 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787506402426910/Screenshot_20260412_104013_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5734&amp;is=6a2d05b4&amp;hm=c363d994bba4b378628ad6ec744729f6384fbd882d682c4797024d9f393bd126&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787506402426910/Screenshot_20260412_104013_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5734&amp;is=6a2d05b4&amp;hm=c363d994bba4b378628ad6ec744729f6384fbd882d682c4797024d9f393bd126&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260412_104013_Revolut.jpg (230.58 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787507254001765/Screenshot_20260412_104042_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5734&amp;is=6a2d05b4&amp;hm=04b81561da1214bd7bad00b434882f4a6792e4f4ae0a2a4e0464ebdb79d09524&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1492787507254001765/Screenshot_20260412_104042_Revolut.jpg?ex=6a2e5734&amp;is=6a2d05b4&amp;hm=04b81561da1214bd7bad00b434882f4a6792e4f4ae0a2a4e0464ebdb79d09524&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260412_104042_Revolut.jpg (408.3 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1493374208573440090 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1493374208573440090><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, April 14, 2026 2:15 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1493374208573440090>4/14/2026 2:15 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Accommodation Dispute Summary – Delayed Damage Claim and Liability Attribution — Airbnb Stay (Bulgaria) — 07/07/2025</strong>

During mid-2025, while travelling abroad and relying heavily on Airbnb as my primary source of accommodation, I stayed at a property in Bulgaria (June 12–17, 2025). Upon checkout, the host confirmed the apartment was in great condition and indicated a 5-star review, with no damage reported. Approximately 13 days later, a claim was submitted alleging wardrobe damage. During that period, multiple intervening guests stayed at the property and publicly described it as “impeccable,” “very clean,” and in “pristine condition,” with everything functioning properly. None reported any issues. Despite this, Airbnb concluded the damage was “timely reported” and attributed liability to me. This contradicts both the delay in reporting and the uninterrupted, positive use of the property by subsequent guests, creating a clear break in accountability and making attribution of responsibility unsupported by the available evidence. This incident reflected a broader pattern of issues I experienced over preceding months and became a catalyst for my decision to purchase a campervan, as I anticipated ongoing accommodation instability and the loss of Airbnb as a viable option.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 8:35 PM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1493374207734841495/Recent_Reviews.png?ex=6a2dd69c&amp;is=6a2c851c&amp;hm=b9ef99ef2ba0312135609b49a1e56c984afd9b174dbd38412e1ee0714e49731f&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1493374207734841495/Recent_Reviews.png?ex=6a2dd69c&amp;is=6a2c851c&amp;hm=b9ef99ef2ba0312135609b49a1e56c984afd9b174dbd38412e1ee0714e49731f&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Recent_Reviews.png (100.61 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1493374208183505136/2025-07_Airbnb_Dispute_Bulgaria_HMEDJ2WRT8_Evidence-Summary.pdf?ex=6a2dd69c&amp;is=6a2c851c&amp;hm=1a27d509799bdf5f147744131d2caf20cc963b7ed0ce857c4668ba8621be6872&amp;"> 2025-07_Airbnb_Dispute_Bulgaria_HMEDJ2WRT8_Evidence-Summary.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.86 MB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1504041722580303954 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1504041722580303954><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, May 13, 2026 12:44 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1504041722580303954>5/13/2026 12:44 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Misaddressed Internal Communication – Conveyancing Email Error and Contextual Explanation — 23/08/2024</strong>

First, context: the thread is a multi-party legal negotiation involving agents, lawyers, and conveyancers. Everyone is copied, and emails are often replied to quickly, sometimes from mobile, sometimes under pressure to meet settlement timelines. That creates a high risk of internal vs external communication getting mixed.

What likely happened with that message:

Internal reaction accidentally sent externally
That line — “This this F%$^&amp; serious” — reads like an internal comment, not a client-facing statement. In conveyancing offices, assistants often react candidly to colleagues when something unexpected or legally sensitive comes through. The tone strongly suggests it was meant for Michelle Kent or another team member, not you.
Misaddressed reply (very common in CC-heavy threads)
Because your email chain included multiple recipients, it’s likely Meagan hit “Reply” or “Reply All” without adjusting recipients, or selected the wrong thread instance. Email clients (especially mobile) make this easy to do under time pressure.
Trigger point: your proposed addendum
Your revised wording introduced:
a retained مبلغ ($3,027.48)
a deemed AGM date
a self-terminating clause
That’s legally specific and not “standard boilerplate.” From their side, this may have:
added complexity late in the process
created risk of delaying settlement
required legal review before proceeding

So internally, her reaction was likely: “this just escalated the deal complexity right before settlement.”

Pressure environment
Earlier emails show urgency:
settlement timing
buyer storage costs
need to update PEXA figures
In that environment, anything that changes contract terms last-minute can trigger stress responses from the conveyancing team.
Why it slipped through
After that message, you immediately responded:
“did you intend to address this to me?” — which confirms even you recognized it as out of place.

That aligns with a simple explanation:
It wasn’t intentional communication to you — it was a leak of internal commentary.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 8:37 PM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041722781499473/Re_Addendum_Rev_3_-_Smith_and_Smith_Purchase_from_Cooke_and_Cooke_1-213_Morgan_Street_Merewether.pdf?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=ada8cd1534b7993628457fb31ef73a502551d0013bbe95608261a8043a8586c6&amp;"> Re_Addendum_Rev_3_-_Smith_and_Smith_Purchase_from_Cooke_and_Cooke_1-213_Morgan_Street_Merewether.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.35 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041723138146374/Screenshot_20240826_121458_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=200a64465156688851d23916141978b8880e473bcd5653dbb8db4eab1d3e9049&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041723138146374/Screenshot_20240826_121458_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=200a64465156688851d23916141978b8880e473bcd5653dbb8db4eab1d3e9049&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240826_121458_Gmail.jpg (304.32 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041723595194398/Screenshot_20240826_121430_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=0130c071918af9cac68c4ac0d7a9c29922aeb330414adaea0e433d43bfc866c5&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041723595194398/Screenshot_20240826_121430_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=0130c071918af9cac68c4ac0d7a9c29922aeb330414adaea0e433d43bfc866c5&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240826_121430_Gmail.jpg (290.18 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041724115423292/Screenshot_20240823_203034_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=85a6442c1ef8431a05621a5cd961642484e8ee41fba2831b800895e3e25f776c&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041724115423292/Screenshot_20240823_203034_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=85a6442c1ef8431a05621a5cd961642484e8ee41fba2831b800895e3e25f776c&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240823_203034_Gmail.jpg (626.94 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041724551626772/Screenshot_20240823_203014_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=bc59ab879d46260effb1218f2f05e8ce2462ff96d8835574864da2d3f42cfee9&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504041724551626772/Screenshot_20240823_203014_Gmail.jpg?ex=6a2e6a02&amp;is=6a2d1882&amp;hm=bc59ab879d46260effb1218f2f05e8ce2462ff96d8835574864da2d3f42cfee9&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240823_203014_Gmail.jpg (415.01 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1504083800647532605 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1504083800647532605><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, May 13, 2026 3:32 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1504083800647532605>5/13/2026 3:32 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>VEILOCITY Ltd – Formation, Administration, and Closure Without Power of Attorney – 08/05/2026</strong>

The email exchange traces the lifecycle of VEILOCITY Ltd, from its establishment in Bulgaria to the user’s later request for closure, with the key condition that no Power of Attorney was ever granted. The company was originally established in response to restrictive KYC practices in Australia, which were, in effect, used in an attempt to traffic me—resulting in the freezing of my bank accounts and forcing the need for an alternative financial structure. Early correspondence focuses on company formation, banking arrangements, and resolving administrative details such as name transliteration. Over time, the lawyer continues to request signatures on updated corporate documents and issues invoices for ongoing registered office services. The user does not proceed with these requests and instead formally seeks closure, explicitly refusing to grant Power of Attorney and requesting direct instructions. The lawyer advises that closure may take approximately eight months and requires certified documentation, including disclosure of the user’s location. The exchange highlights a procedural tension between formal legal requirements and the user’s intent to retain full control without delegated authority. KYC regulations claim to enforce transparency and accountability, yet their irony is exposed when placed alongside the failures revealed in the Epstein Files.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 8:37 PM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083801020698684/VEILOCITY_Ltd_Formation_Administration_and_Closure_Without_Power_of_Attorney.pdf?ex=6a2de872&amp;is=6a2c96f2&amp;hm=0847535b44a30500ceb9266951416fc1834c35117579cc189c87525f2166e5db&amp;"> VEILOCITY_Ltd_Formation_Administration_and_Closure_Without_Power_of_Attorney.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>454.97 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083801721016400/2026-05-13_13-22-50.png?ex=6a2de872&amp;is=6a2c96f2&amp;hm=3ed088967f021e616c2ce4a54b5cf962dfdaf53d5534ab555b17fbb06e0fa08e&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083801721016400/2026-05-13_13-22-50.png?ex=6a2de872&amp;is=6a2c96f2&amp;hm=3ed088967f021e616c2ce4a54b5cf962dfdaf53d5534ab555b17fbb06e0fa08e&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 2026-05-13_13-22-50.png (578.21 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083802304155752/2026-05-13_13-23-32.png?ex=6a2de872&amp;is=6a2c96f2&amp;hm=5b34ae12018d4e66ebb994a2aa20c9d9f68a5df6d1951f26b8f99b237bd709da&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083802304155752/2026-05-13_13-23-32.png?ex=6a2de872&amp;is=6a2c96f2&amp;hm=5b34ae12018d4e66ebb994a2aa20c9d9f68a5df6d1951f26b8f99b237bd709da&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 2026-05-13_13-23-32.png (318.11 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083802757267496/2026-05-13_13-24-20.png?ex=6a2de873&amp;is=6a2c96f3&amp;hm=e199d48c85e794cfb07565b12738f5ff8cbfec4ba0915b1647b56c248ed43ba9&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504083802757267496/2026-05-13_13-24-20.png?ex=6a2de873&amp;is=6a2c96f3&amp;hm=e199d48c85e794cfb07565b12738f5ff8cbfec4ba0915b1647b56c248ed43ba9&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 2026-05-13_13-24-20.png (315.63 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/14663562417387602