div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1504394001430745151 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1504394001430745151><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 12:04 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1504394001430745151>5/14/2026 12:04 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Faith Correspondence and Draft Will – Personal Beliefs, Church Engagement and Testamentary Intentions — 2025</strong>

The correspondence and attached materials collectively document Stephen Cooke’s written communications with family members during January 2025, alongside his broader personal faith journey, interactions with Hunter Bible Church, and his recorded wishes and intentions. During a period of marital breakdown and ongoing divorce proceedings, Stephen articulates his spiritual beliefs, emotional state, and personal boundaries, expressing concern about vulnerability, perceived judgment shaped by third-party narratives, and a need to avoid emotionally unsafe environments until legal matters are resolved. He references prior written reflections on his relationship with God, describing faith as a source of emotional stability during extreme distress, while also acknowledging the ongoing difficulty of feeling heard or understood.

The materials outline his understanding of how God communicates through reflection, Scripture, lived experience, and recurring spiritual themes. They also demonstrate his effort to clarify that he does not claim prophetic authority, but instead seeks to honour Christ through personal testimony, prayer, and continued learning within a church community. Family responses within the correspondence reflect concern, disagreement with certain interpretations, and encouragement toward grounding and professional support.

Additionally, the documents incorporate formative life experiences—including childhood illness, family dynamics, and fatherhood—that have shaped his perspectives on faith, suffering, and purpose. Included within this body of material is Stephen Cooke’s draft Last Will and Testament, which, while acknowledged as requiring further legal refinement, records his explicit intentions regarding executors, guardianship of his children, distribution of his estate, funeral arrangements, and medical directives. The will is presented as a clear expression of his personal values, spiritual perspective, and present intentions during a period of significant psychological, emotional, and situational vulnerability.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504394001527083169/Will_Email_-_Needs_work_and_my_wishes_and_intentions.pdf?ex=6a2e6098&amp;is=6a2d0f18&amp;hm=01d5f2d04044c7ee86bf0aca2d861f721effd605784f4e660c07eb34b1f9ecf9&amp;"> Will_Email_-_Needs_work_and_my_wishes_and_intentions.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>3.27 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504394001984524328/Advising_the_church_my_relationship_with_God.pdf?ex=6a2e6098&amp;is=6a2d0f18&amp;hm=c5469159bbbb5a7b3572dc7dd54d4b62ab24482eba1299bc2e4fb031522ba5c1&amp;"> Advising_the_church_my_relationship_with_God.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.31 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachmen