<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1504418360769646753 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1504418360769646753><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 1:41 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1504418360769646753>5/14/2026 1:41 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Decision to Self-Represent and Alcohol Restriction Dispute — Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023) - 19/10/2024</strong>

This correspondence outlines Stephen Cooke’s decision to self-represent, set against a broader dispute regarding proposed alcohol-related parenting conditions. The material demonstrates a clear divergence in professional legal views, as reflected in the “Diff of Opinion” document, which indicates no settled or unanimous position supporting alcohol-specific restrictions against the Father. This lack of consensus is contrasted by proposed amendments in the “OS Legal Restriction on Alcohol – Father Only” materials, which shift from previously balanced conditions to a unilateral restriction applied solely to him, without new substantiated evidence.

Stephen further highlights procedural concerns, including the failure of his former legal representatives to provide his voluntary drug and alcohol test results—produced in February 2024—to the family report writer, despite repeated efforts and cost. This omission, occurring on multiple occasions, contributed to his decision to subpoena the records directly to ensure their inclusion.

The combined effect of contested legal positioning, evidentiary omissions, financial strain, and personal impact supports his position that self-representation is necessary to ensure fairness, proper consideration of evidence, and protection of his parental interests.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504418360816046171/Gmail_-_Re__Additional_Context_Regarding_My_Decision_to_Self-Represent.pdf?ex=6a2dce87&amp;is=6a2c7d07&amp;hm=aff7585bb846255699943f4692ef927353ff8d975946895096af7877d990b8f5&amp;"> Gmail_-_Re__Additional_Context_Regarding_My_Decision_to_Self-Represent.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>260.5 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1504512457912356996 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1504512457912356996><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 7:55 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1504512457912356996>5/14/2026 7:55 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Initial Separation Correspondence – Asset Removal, Police Involvement and Urgent Legal Response — Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023) — 04/12/2023</strong>

This correspondence documents the immediate circumstances following the parties’ separation between 2 and 4 December 2023, capturing a period of acute instability involving the removal of assets, police attendance, and urgent legal engagement. The material records the Applicant Father’s communications expressing concern for the children’s distress and uncertainty regarding how to respond without escalating the situation. It reflects real-time attempts to seek guidance while law enforcement involvement was pending or underway, with advice provided to remain measured and factual in reporting events. The exchanges highlight early assertions of safety concerns in relation to the children’s care, alongside efforts to ensure that any incidents were formally documented for potential evidentiary use. Overall, the correspondence provides contemporaneous evidence of the breakdown of the relationship, the rapid escalation of conflict, and the Applicant’s initial steps to navigate legal and protective processes under significant emotional and situational pressure.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 14, 2026 7:57 PM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504512459766239393/1.jpg?ex=6a2e262a&amp;is=6a2cd4aa&amp;hm=321a2f11a7d7bea92e99da89e426cee5a8c86d74606e02ded68eb8e7ed0d4c6d&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504512459766239393/1.jpg?ex=6a2e262a&amp;is=6a2cd4aa&amp;hm=321a2f11a7d7bea92e99da89e426cee5a8c86d74606e02ded68eb8e7ed0d4c6d&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 1.jpg (5.6 MB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1504512460282003686/2.jpg?ex=6a2e262b&amp;is=6a2cd4ab&amp;hm=f75d4f567e664c31783d47e3429edea771309a704fc4937692d53639d7ee2fde&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cd