div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>152 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505624342166241442/23-Jul-2024_1115_Costs_Notice_Mr_Stephen_Christopher_Cooke.pdf?ex=6a2e3d30&amp;is=6a2cebb0&amp;hm=148fd887e860b1978db857fe83d2cdadaa001471c7bdfb736d6cb07e5ea565c1&amp;"> 23-Jul-2024_1115_Costs_Notice_Mr_Stephen_Christopher_Cooke.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>55.62 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505624342514372850/23-Jul-2024_1115_Costs_Notice_Mr_Stephen_C-5EC95.pdf?ex=6a2e3d30&amp;is=6a2cebb0&amp;hm=b0d25e20f54a6777e44f6d366c490617545ea35cda7061cfe3d7d34171e7a63c&amp;"> 23-Jul-2024_1115_Costs_Notice_Mr_Stephen_C-5EC95.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>55.62 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505818788078030961 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505818788078030961><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 10:26 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505818788078030961>5/18/2026 10:26 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Compliance Without Contribution — Limited Voice in Court-Directed Process - 18/12/2024</strong>

This material documents procedural steps following court orders in Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023), centred on the appointment of a Single Expert to prepare a Family Report. A draft joint letter of instruction was issued by the Respondent Mother’s solicitors with a strict deadline for execution and submission. While framed as a joint document, the Applicant Father was not provided a meaningful opportunity to contribute to its content prior to being required to sign.

The Applicant complied with the court’s directions by signing the letter and confirming payment of required costs, but explicitly noted this limitation in participation.

The instruction letter itself defines the expert’s role, relying on extensive pre-selected materials and subpoenas, and imposes strict procedural rules governing communication and document flow.

Overall, the documents reflect a process where formal compliance is achieved, but the Applicant’s ability to influence foundational instructions is constrained, highlighting a core tension between procedural obligation and meaningful participation.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505818788216569896/Joint_Letter_Email.pdf?ex=6a2e4987&amp;is=6a2cf807&amp;hm=e20744600682e675362b0ffeeb0652e68e35498cfd6f65b2abb71d9efba4b1d9&amp;"> Joint_Letter_Email.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>865.58 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505818788472291429/Signed_Joint_Letter_23122024.pdf?ex=6a2e4987&amp;is=6a2cf807&amp;hm=0102b546338ccbb6ed3b84a97135a0717f2e7c0dc960febfc207697ba7af311a&amp;"> Signed_Joint_Letter_23122024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>744.9 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505818788707176508/Signed_Joint_Letter_Applicant.pdf?ex=6a2e4987&amp;is=6a2cf807&amp;hm=b7ccccf547735db70b3d866f7334df48fd2a0e10a14f317e8eb9d1c309423e65&amp;"> Signed_Joint_Letter_Applicant.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.43 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505818788988321893/18.12.24_Draft_Joint_Letter_of_Appointment_to_Drew_Cowen_-_Family_Report.pdf?ex=6a2e4988&amp;is=6a2cf808&amp;hm=75ce926cd697f2be70d677a35d99dce064b3465d2ceb9812ffa63b694d62a23d&amp;"> 18.12.24_Draft_Joint_Letter_of_Appointment_to_Drew_Cowen_-_Family_Report.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>673.96 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505825326033408040 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505825326033408040><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 10:52 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505825326033408040>5/18/2026 10:52 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve>Joint Instruction for Family Report – Core Parenting Issues and Expert Assessment <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128104;‍&#128105;‍&#128103;‍&#128102;"
    title="family_mwgb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f468-200d-1f469-200d-1f467-200d-1f466.svg"> - 10/10/2024

This document is a formal joint letter of instruction in the matter of Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023), issued to psychologist Drew Cowen for the preparation of a Single Expert Report under the Family Law Rules. It confirms representation for both parents and outlines agreed arrangements for interviews with the parties and children. The letter directs the expert to assess key parenting issues, including the children’s views, relationships with each parent, each parent’s capacity and willingness to support the children’s wellbeing and relationships, and any risks of psychological or physical harm. It also requires evaluation of family dynamics, potential impacts of changes in living arrangements, and any history of family violence. The matter is progressing through the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia, with no final hearing yet set. The report is intended to inform future proceedings, with both parties equally responsible for the $15,000 plus GST cost. Communication transparency and provision of all relevant documents, including subpoenaed material, are emphasized to ensure a fair and comprehensive expert assessment.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505825326331072562/Court_Portal_-_Leave_Status_2024-11-01_at_13-49-28.png?ex=6a2e4f9e&amp;is=6a2cfe1e&amp;hm=09745c8fde2e29a0a422701c7d5b4328403da75a58eadcc959aa9401a8388199&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505825326331072562/Court_Portal_-_Leave_Status_2024-11-01_at_13-49-28.png?ex=6a2e4f9e&amp;is=6a2cfe1e&amp;hm=09745c8fde2e29a0a422701c7d5b4328403da75a58eadcc959aa9401a8388199&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Court_Portal_-_Leave_Status_2024-11-01_at_13-49-28.png (87.07 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg>