377771c4c&amp;"> Email_-_Joint_Instruction_for_Family_Report.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.06 MB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505827336182956064 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505827336182956064><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 11:00 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505827336182956064>5/18/2026 11:00 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Self-Representation, Evidence Access, and Family Conflict — 23/10/2024</strong>

Stephen Cooke outlines his decision to self-represent in ongoing family court proceedings after expending approximately $200,000 in legal fees and additional costs for drug and alcohol testing, without key evidence being properly presented to the court or the Family Report writer. He states that only through self-representation was he able to successfully issue a subpoena, obtain critical medical and assessment documents, and ensure their direct submission to both the court and the report writer, making them formally considered in parenting determinations. He acknowledges the emotional impact of the matter on his family and expresses appreciation for their concern. In response, his father expresses strong disapproval, focusing on Stephen’s lack of full-time employment. He criticizes this as irresponsible and damaging to both financial stability and parental credibility, arguing it risks court outcomes and reflects a failure to meet fundamental obligations to himself and his children, ultimately straining their relationship.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505827336283750511/Self-Representation_Evidence_Access_and_Family_Conflict_23-10-2024.pdf?ex=6a2e517d&amp;is=6a2cfffd&amp;hm=d885a238bd49be32b92aa555531f4edc07b62092b217b8d564e04f855ea9f841&amp;"> Self-Representation_Evidence_Access_and_Family_Conflict_23-10-2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>292.5 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505830668725391371 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505830668725391371><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 11:13 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505830668725391371>5/18/2026 11:13 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Merewether Property Sale Coordination and Settlement Clarifications — Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023) — August 2024</strong>

This email chain relates to the pending sale of the Merewether property within ongoing family law proceedings, focusing on administrative and financial requirements necessary for settlement. Key issues raised include the need for an ATO clearance certificate to avoid tax withholding, confirmation of which loans are secured against the property, and instructions for distributing net sale proceeds into a legal trust account in accordance with court orders. It is confirmed that three specific loans are tied to the Merewether property, while a separate loan remains secured against the Southport property. The correspondence reflects coordination between legal representatives and conveyancers to ensure compliance with orders and avoid delays.

Subsequent updates confirm that the ATO certificate process has been addressed and clarify loan responsibilities. Alongside these legal and financial matters, Stephen provides personal context, describing significant fatigue, relocation challenges, and efforts to stabilize his living situation for the children ahead of settlement.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830669455069285/Email_Merewether_Property_Sale_Coordination_and_Settlement_Clarification.pdf?ex=6a2e5498&amp;is=6a2d0318&amp;hm=02da95b2e5be514785417ff25ccc46ed3621f9555495594ba911cb43e18a9bc7&amp;"> Email_Merewether_Property_Sale_Coordination_and_Settlement_Clarification.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>465.58 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830669924827238/Screenshot_20240819_113421_Connect.jpg?ex=6a2e5498&amp;is=6a2d0318&amp;hm=10212aab3f1f5fb765448b8a6dd6ba5a24e2681dc758cc175b613001235a3c7b&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830669924827238/Screenshot_20240819_113421_Connect.jpg?ex=6a2e5498&amp;is=6a2d0318&amp;hm=10212aab3f1f5fb765448b8a6dd6ba5a24e2681dc758cc175b613001235a3c7b&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240819_113421_Connect.jpg (182.9 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830670419886173/20240815_172556.jpg?ex=6a2e5498&amp;is=6a2d0318&amp;hm=312aa51fc6af5c760e182081f056e53981a8ef7717d6a25b9c2028599e13d008&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830670419886173/20240815_172556.jpg?ex=6a2e5498&amp;is=6a2d0318&amp;hm=312aa51fc6af5c760e182081f056e53981a8ef7717d6a25b9c2028599e13d008&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 20240815_172556.jpg (2.51 MB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830671229128876/20240817_120030.jpg?ex=6a2e5499&amp;is=6a2d0319&amp;hm=1f97ff06d2543d5eeebf4cf87c63a3970f7c9ab8336c8d8c23ed15a44a9f3182&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505830671229128876/20240817_120030.jpg?ex=6a2e5499&amp;is=6a2d0319&amp;hm=1f97ff06d2543d5eeebf4cf87c63a3970f7c9ab8336c8d8c23ed15a44a9f3182&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: 20240817_120030.jpg (2.69 MB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505834414628929538 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505834414628929538><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 11:28 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505834414628929538>5/18/2026 11:28 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Self-Representation, Subpoena Strategy &amp; Parenting Dispute Escalation — 10/10/2024</strong>

This correspondence and supporting documents outline a critical phase in family law proceedings involving parenting arrangements, evidentiary disputes, and legal representation breakdown. The father seeks to secure and formally present drug and alcohol testing records—previously obtained but not effectively submitted—by issuing subpoenas to ensure inclusion in court consideration and the Family Report.

At the same time, he moves to amend his application to pursue a 50/50 shared parenting arrangement, expressing concern that proposed changes unfairly impose alcohol restrictions solely on him despite existing equal conditions.

The material highlights procedural complexities, including approval requirements for subpoenas, limitations on document sharing, and strategic disagreements with legal counsel regarding necessity and timing.

Due to perceived inefficiencies, costs, and failure to advance key evidence, the father elects to self-represent, prioritizing direct control over case progression and outcomes affecting his children.

Earlier records confirm drug and alcohol testing was voluntarily undertaken and shared with prior lawyers, reinforcing his position that relevant evidence existed but was not properly utilised.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505834415266201620/Email_self-Representation_Subpoena_Strategy__Parenting_Dispute_Escalation.pdf?ex=6a2e5815&amp;is=6a2d0695&amp;hm=b7ec9f19d86dc9e678f15ae506fa35b00f3f8816eee632132c82c9f66c6ce2b3&amp;"> Email_self-Representation_Subpoena_Strategy__Parenting_Dispute_Escalation.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>603.75 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505834415656276079/Exhibit_A.pdf?ex=6a2e5815&amp;is=6a2d0695&amp;hm=ac2c93e650638c37697bfce36728bd3084e07e5ec620f262bd503182c0f2c369&amp;"> Exhibit_A.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.48 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505834416084090911/without_prejudice_Parenting_Orders_offer.pdf?ex=6a2e5815&amp;is=6a2d0695&amp;hm=3a0d041c4256b6c0785bcfc6afed61175aa6bde967abe4688b2e1b1bbeec4f45&amp;"> without_prejudice_Parenting_Orders_offer.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>518.45 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505834416684142672/Drug_and_Alcohol_-_Stephen_Cooke.pdf?ex=6a2e5815&amp;is=6a2d0695&amp;hm=0abb9b10f46ce90dc9ff7a7526cbb8f58cbbe8cf80728d3c158c3b70ebff4c91&amp;"> Drug_and_Alcohol_-_Stephen_Cooke.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>11.3 MB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505836756912832663 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505836756912832663><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 11:37 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505836756912832663>5/18/2026 11:37 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>ATO Clearance Certificate &amp; Property Sale Compliance — 07/08/2024</strong>

This material documents the vendor’s compliance process for the sale of a property in Merewether, NSW, including taxation, title, and conveyancing requirements. Following exchange of contracts on 12 July 2024 with settlement scheduled for 23 August 2024, the vendor submitted an Australian Taxation Office (ATO) Foreign Resident Capital Gains Withholding clearance certificate application on 7 August 2024 to confirm Australian residency status and avoid withholding obligations.

The property title confirms joint ownership with Heather Cooke, subject to a Westpac mortgage and a caveat lodged by JustFund Finance, indicating additional financial interests requiring resolution prior to settlement.

Correspondence shows the clearance process was delayed after the initial request was diverted to spam, prompting follow-up with conveyancers and submission confirmation.

Additional queries raised by the vendor highlight concerns regarding mortgage discharge, treatment of the caveat, and adherence to court-ordered financial arrangements, reflecting the legal and financial complexity surrounding the transaction.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505836757004976189/Email_ATO_Clearance_Certificate__Property_Sale_Compliance.pdf?ex=6a2e5a43&amp;is=6a2d08c3&amp;hm=93ddfa0071ae8433cf436dbd7d5b004c50f956d88c4b62781bdd7ad482b79551&amp;"> Email_ATO_Clearance_Certificate__Property_Sale_Compliance.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.08 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505836757323747389/ATO_receipt_ID_2410977695206.pdf?ex=6a2e5a44&amp;is=6a2d08c4&amp;hm=1ef4e7256a8165cd8a59018db3d486b5531ac8ebb79444f5fbf5a9bfa7a2fd47&amp;"> ATO_receipt_ID_2410977695206.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>153.64 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505836757634252851/579155_-_NSW_Title_-_1_SP91905.pdf?ex=6a2e5a44&amp;is=6a2d08c4&amp;hm=3e78024c033ab8daa81433fe0ae6d18c930cba4eea31940fffc382eb308eda16&amp;"> 579155_-_NSW_Title_-_1_SP91905.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>31.74 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class