<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1505840717556351047 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1505840717556351047><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, May 18, 2026 11:53 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1505840717556351047>5/18/2026 11:53 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Applicant Wife’s Tender Bundle &amp; Affidavit Evidence — Property, Compliance and Financial Dispute - 31/05/2024</strong>

This material forms part of the Applicant Wife’s tender bundle supporting her affidavit filed 31 May 2024 in proceedings NCC3896/2023 before the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia. It compiles documentary evidence including text messages, agent correspondence, invoices, and solicitor communications relating to the sale of the Merewether property. The bundle is used to substantiate claims of non-compliance with prior court orders, particularly regarding property condition, access for sale preparation, and responsibility for maintenance and costs. Supporting documents include payment confirmations for repair works, communications from the real estate agent raising concerns about cleanliness and readiness for sale, and correspondence asserting the Respondent’s obligations under existing orders. The material aligns with the broader application seeking financial adjustments, enforcement of obligations, and evidentiary support for claims regarding conduct, property management, and associated financial responsibilities.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505840718189432932/Email_Applicant_Wife_Tender_Bundle__Affidavit_Evidence_Property.pdf?ex=6a2e5df4&amp;is=6a2d0c74&amp;hm=a330dc2b7a5c11e6c6342efd0c5344d10f891c1b06c86990a77bd1105b64f4c2&amp;"> Email_Applicant_Wife_Tender_Bundle__Affidavit_Evidence_Property.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>803.76 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505840718495748217/Tender_Bundle_for_Affidavit_of_Heather_Cooke_filed_31.05.24.pdf?ex=6a2e5df4&amp;is=6a2d0c74&amp;hm=cd98e84f44583a313f45648f44f1fd990d7b3324bc1fb54f46246e175029507c&amp;"> Tender_Bundle_for_Affidavit_of_Heather_Cooke_filed_31.05.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.16 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505840718772699367/Application_in_a_Proceeding_filed_31.05.24.pdf?ex=6a2e5df4&amp;is=6a2d0c74&amp;hm=c307144d9582af28b8cdca399f384488f985730a066b7a25f490fd0d6be37894&amp;"> Application_in_a_Proceeding_filed_31.05.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>9.85 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505840719150055424/Amended_Financial_Statement_filed_31.05.24.pdf?ex=6a2e5df4&amp;is=6a2d0c74&amp;hm=130868d13cafc21e45521e6e8cf6def238c3391a7e341e3a208fa08ec2672b77&amp;"> Amended_Financial_Statement_filed_31.05.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>5.49 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1505840719485730967/Affidavit_of_Heather_Cooke_filed_31.05.24.pdf?ex=6a2e5df4&amp;is=6a2d0c74&amp;hm=0b90b18818c347843a756b01c53f41d7278a06961268a5bfbd0d867d3c4deab1&amp;"> Affidavit_of_Heather_Cooke_filed_31.05.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>8.45 MB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1506893916643791009 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1506893916643791009><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 21, 2026 9:38 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1506893916643791009>5/21/2026 9:38 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127947;️‍♂️"
    title="man_lifting_weights"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3cb-fe0f-200d-2642-fe0f.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"> EMF Fitness &amp; E C Legal — Gym Membership “Energy Theft” &amp; Bankruptcy Fallout — 23/11/2025</strong>

This document trail captures what can be viewed as part of a broader pattern of systematic financial and administrative pressure occurring during a period of significant personal, legal, and emotional strain. At the centre is a highly familiar modern “gym membership trap” scenario — a relatively minor subscription issue escalating into disproportionate legal and financial consequences. Before the disputed fee had fully escalated, Stephen Cooke formally contacted EMF Fitness requesting cancellation of his non-contract membership after leaving Australia for an extended period. He explained he could no longer physically attend the gym and requested a remote cancellation method due to being overseas. Despite repeated written attempts to resolve the matter cooperatively, the cancellation process became obstructed after a dishonoured payment appeared on the account, with EMF Fitness advising the cancellation could not proceed until payment was first made.

The dispute later escalated into debt collection and legal threats through E C Legal Pty Ltd, transforming what began as a relatively small gym membership issue into a larger liability that ultimately appeared among debts disclosed in bankruptcy proceedings accepted by the Australian Financial Security Authority on 22 November 2025. Within the broader context of concurrent legal battles, financial exhaustion, and mounting systemic pressures, the situation is perceived not as an isolated dispute but as another layer in a wider pattern of institutional coercion and cumulative bullying.

At its core, the material reflects a rejection of systems, policies, and business models perceived to operate through procedural obstruction, automated extraction, and pressure-based compliance rather than genuine human resolution. Entities operating through deceptive or predatory practices of this nature increasingly have no meaningful place within Stephen’s reality, values, or future interactions.</span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Thursday, May 21, 2026 9:41 AM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506893916786659338/EMAIL_-_EMF_Fitness__E_C_Lega.pdf?ex=6a2e3e52&amp;is=6a2cecd2&amp;hm=40937100497745c91f300c6c9484956a79b3cc34427d77adcb2e5d9edf1c39a7&amp;"> EMAIL_-_EMF_Fitness__E_C_Lega.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>516.76 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506893917071868104/insolv2150cmread1763832681531651159.pdf?ex=6a2e3e52&amp;is=6a2cecd2&amp;hm=d20c6494c2ca848a10eb5577114ba627446a67d0f29ebc941e30bd778534765b&amp;"> insolv2150cmread1763832681531651159.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>23.62 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506893917381988482/EMF_Membership_Cancellation_Emails_StephenCooke.pdf?ex=6a2e3e52&amp;is=6a2cecd2&amp;hm=92654f2342df722531191bbabbb97f3f2b0a77a9946db1293c9ceb40484d504b&amp;"> EMF_Membership_Cancellation_Emails_StephenCooke.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>259.51 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506893917818323004/Notice_of_Intent_to_Sue_-_21_days_-_Gyms250925130224458.pdf?ex=6a2e3e52&amp;is=6a2cecd2&amp;hm=8db27596859320bc368466c95641e2e6675b4f330a6c709ace300de8dfde56dc&amp;"> Notice_of_Intent_to_Sue_-_21_days_-_Gyms250925130224458.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>145.96 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1506903413315862548 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1506903413315862548><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 21, 2026 10:16 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1506903413315862548>5/21/2026 10:16 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128187;"
    title="computer"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4bb.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"> Rebuilding Through Adversity | Employment, Retraining &amp; IT Career Transition 10/07/2024</strong>

Throughout 2024, Stephen Cooke actively pursued a structured transition into the IT and cybersecurity sector while navigating significant legal, financial, and personal pressures. Evidence demonstrates sustained efforts to rebuild employment stability through industry networking, recruitment outreach, professional interviews, self-funded education, and technical project development. Stephen engaged with recruiters, CTOs, employment clinics, and technology firms including Diamond IT, where he progressed through formal interview processes and discussions surrounding a pathway from internship into long-term employment and consultancy work.

Supporting documentation shows substantial independent investment into CompTIA Network+ and Security+ certification pathways, ongoing Udemy training milestones, Linux systems administration, networking, Docker, OpenWRT customization, SSL infrastructure, reverse proxy deployment, and cybersecurity-focused project work. His employment history further demonstrates a longstanding professional background with leadership, customer service, and sales achievements, including award recognition at Aon Canada.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506903413441695744/Wed_Jun_12_2024_at_543_PM_-_Employment_Status_Update.pdf?ex=6a2e472a&amp;is=6a2cf5aa&amp;hm=0d9e84b8da6a4257ffabd5150a29c25970e3be8d51bc445319ba388047f63658&amp;"> Wed_Jun_12_2024_at_543_PM_-_Employment_Status_Update.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>92.73 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1506903413693087784/Fri_Jun_21_2024_at_233_PM_-_Gmail_-_Employment_Clinic_for_Newly_Arrived_Migrants_-_Follow_Up_Zoom_Sessions.pdf?ex=6a2e472a&amp;is=6a2cf5aa&amp;hm=b4cdf5b2eb2dc23d9855551aa25b132fa6a5b3b4a42476575be9c29bd3daed6c&amp;"> Fri_Jun_21_2024_at_233_PM_-_Gmail_-_Employment_Clinic_for_Newly_Arrived_Migrants_-_Follow_Up_Zoom_Sessions.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>197.27 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://