<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508018739252170892 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508018739252170892><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, May 24, 2026 12:08 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508018739252170892>5/24/2026 12:08 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128220;"
    title="scroll"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4dc.svg"><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"> Family Law Mediation &amp; Property Valuation Dispute – Mounting Costs, Incomplete Disclosure &amp; Pressure to Proceed - 13/05/2024</strong>

This correspondence captures a critical stage in Stephen Cooke’s family law proceedings, where substantial financial and procedural pressure was being applied in preparation for mediation despite ongoing concerns regarding incomplete disclosure from the opposing party. Clarity Lawyers formally issued mediation documentation, including agreements and preparatory materials requested by the mediator, while simultaneously outlining the significant financial burden associated with the process. The projected mediation costs exceeded $9,600 AUD inclusive of GST, covering mediator fees, travel expenses, venue hire, and legal representation costs, all of which were to be funded from trust monies already held on Stephen’s behalf.

At the same time, Stephen raised serious concerns that the matter was not procedurally ready for mediation due to insufficient financial disclosure from the other side. He referenced prior attempts to delay the mediation through his legal representatives, indicating a belief that proceeding prematurely would place him at a strategic disadvantage. The communications reflect growing frustration around being pressured into an expensive legal process before all relevant financial information had been properly produced and examined.

The matter also involved disputes surrounding the valuation of the Como Crescent property, with urgency placed on selecting a valuer and finalising instructions before mediation commenced. This added further pressure to an already financially and emotionally demanding process.

Family law solicitor Matthew Shepherd acknowledged concerns regarding readiness for mediation while also encouraging Stephen to “give it our best shot” in an attempt to avoid further litigation. His correspondence additionally highlighted the escalating financial reality of family court proceedings, including mediator fees, travel costs, barrister considerations, and logistical burdens associated with in-person attendance. The emails collectively portray a legal environment where substantial funds were being consumed through procedural processes while Stephen simultaneously expressed concerns regarding fairness, disclosure obligations, and the broader imbalance of the proceedings.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508018739629522954/Mediation_-_Some_Common_Questions.pdf?ex=6a2e6165&amp;is=6a2d0fe5&amp;hm=6a9098599a2e304d95def3bbaa93799d7d2afabeb24394d317bff276b3204f61&amp;"> Mediation_-_Some_Common_Questions.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>395.9 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508018740195885089/Cooke_MEDIATION_AGT_.pdf?ex=6a2e6165&amp;is=6a2d0fe5&amp;hm=6871cf9510e1937a2d0fba25b8f805787e307f5238707823f09980838040aeec&amp;"> Cooke_MEDIATION_AGT_.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>147.55 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508018740539953282/Family_Law_Mediation_Mounting_Costs_Incomplete_Disclosure__Pressure_to_Proceed.pdf?ex=6a2e6165&amp;is=6a2d0fe5&amp;hm=3b500e828b2edf56da97c724e19e79db76ff741609ad63e64a872e6cb2ef676d&amp;"> Family_Law_Mediation_Mounting_Costs_Incomplete_Disclosure__Pressure_to_Proceed.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>835.01 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508023604116193480 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508023604116193480><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, May 24, 2026 12:27 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508023604116193480>5/24/2026 12:27 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127968;"
    title="house"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3e0.svg"> Family Law Proceedings, Mediation Pressure &amp; Financial Exhaustion 16/05/2024</strong>

This material documents a highly pressured stage of Stephen Cooke’s family law proceedings involving escalating legal costs, mediation disputes, property sale conflicts, and severe financial strain. By May 2024, legal invoices had already exceeded $100,000 AUD, while new cost agreements projected a further $90,000+ if litigation continued to trial. Significant funds were rapidly consumed through solicitors, barristers, mediation preparation, forensic accounting, valuations, and court processes.

Stephen repeatedly expressed concerns that mediation scheduled for June 2024 was premature due to insufficient financial disclosure from the opposing side. Despite this, pressure continued to proceed with mediation, property valuations, and sale preparations. Stephen also raised concerns regarding possible conflicts of interest involving real estate agents connected to his former spouse’s professional circle.

The documents additionally show Stephen defending allegations regarding the condition of the marital home by supplying electrical safety invoices, bulk waste collection records, photographs, and evidence disputing claims of neglect or damage. Simultaneously, he sought access to investment funds to maintain legal representation and financial survival during increasingly complex proceedings.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508023604581765240/EMAIL_-_Family_Law_Proceedings_Mediation_Pressure__Financial_Exhaustion.pdf?ex=6a2e65ed&amp;is=6a2d146d&amp;hm=26be7e7e16fbe80b80e580cdbd1f336b6f59a95890883aac694db6587d202ad4&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Family_Law_Proceedings_Mediation_Pressure__Financial_Exhaustion.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>489.43 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508023605106180177/Gmail_-_Praemium_Re_Waiting_for_the_sell_down_-_Request_for_Partial_Withdrawal_of_30000_from_SMA00418788.pdf?ex=6a2e65ed&amp;is=6a2d146d&amp;hm=4162ae03ffce70087b1cc2c3867575595e95c2c44cd1ac4f6e3110086a53e977&amp;"> Gmail_-_Praemium_Re_Waiting_for_the_sell_down_-_Request_for_Partial_Withdrawal_of_30000_from_SMA00418788.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>185.06 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508023605336739961/Gmail_