edf3f83e03235697895644dd0dc&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508033016692215818/Nov_22_2023_-_Signal_msg_from_Heather_-_Funds.jpg?ex=6a2e6eb1&amp;is=6a2d1d31&amp;hm=185223ce5bb3ddcce4246bcdaa1ed1c7c9ec8edf3f83e03235697895644dd0dc&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Nov_22_2023_-_Signal_msg_from_Heather_-_Funds.jpg (810.07 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508035608499585034 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508035608499585034><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, May 24, 2026 1:15 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508035608499585034>5/24/2026 1:15 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Financial Disclosure Disputes, Condo Investigations &amp; Mediation Concerns – Cooke vs Cooke 07/06/2024</strong>

This correspondence concerns escalating disputes regarding financial disclosure, mediation readiness, and property settlement negotiations in the Cooke family law proceedings during June 2024. Stephen Cooke, through Ramsden Family Law, sought extensive disclosure relating to bank accounts, mortgages, historical property transactions, loan redraws, superannuation balances, and financial movements associated with Heather Cooke’s Southport condominium and other accounts. Particular concern was raised regarding substantial transfers made shortly before separation, including funds allegedly withdrawn from joint facilities without consent, as well as uncertainty surrounding the historical sale proceeds of Heather’s prior Queensland property and how those funds were later applied. The material reflects Stephen’s position that mediation and the forced sale of the marital home should not proceed until complete financial disclosure had been provided and independently reviewed, including by a forensic accountant. Concerns were also expressed regarding potential conflicts involving real estate agents, perceived pressure surrounding the sale process, incomplete disclosure, and the risk of entering mediation without a full understanding of the matrimonial asset pool. The documents additionally show active legal exchanges between solicitors regarding disclosure compliance, updated financial records, QSuper balances, trust structures, and the broader issue of ensuring transparency and fairness before any final property resolution.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035608671424532/EMAIL_-_Financial_Disclosure_Disputes_Condo_Investigations__Mediation_Concerns.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=58a6975d10ce8550ea63698366a2d9575f1cbecf2a50686948102569bfbdd108&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Financial_Disclosure_Disputes_Condo_Investigations__Mediation_Concerns.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.04 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035608940118106/docs_received_from_os_7.7.24.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=eef25da8d449b88cf07776f60fd1275cbe501f47c02327ebe66da55d69ffda97&amp;"> docs_received_from_os_7.7.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>441.05 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035609174868008/Q_Super_Screenshot_of_Balance_as_at_04.06.24.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=9a1c176bc201ef17495d35ea633f8a9a277b095f3e624c71bb46c7ab7b4dc776&amp;"> Q_Super_Screenshot_of_Balance_as_at_04.06.24.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>225.21 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035609476731011/Screenshot_20240608_203148_Firefox.jpg?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=9cd95526fabcce3c37974025be3e3517bc842f463dc7c3d705d6387ddf379510&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035609476731011/Screenshot_20240608_203148_Firefox.jpg?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=9cd95526fabcce3c37974025be3e3517bc842f463dc7c3d705d6387ddf379510&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20240608_203148_Firefox.jpg (605.71 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035609665732769/2919_Jul13-Jan14.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=4766ccc7947803b68cfa146122eb1edf55f912de23c69ceb90b295c4603280db&amp;"> 2919_Jul13-Jan14.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>25.23 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035609946620005/2919_Jan_13-Jul13.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=be2ec26996aa8d7e046c3ac885cc5b7a82cdee7166e7c7e84536b8752999563a&amp;"> 2919_Jan_13-Jul13.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>25.9 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035610177179734/2919_Jul12-Jan13.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=06c6dd420f366a3eb118243c954b505c9d5cae64bf9e2a62b3a4d02ddba9e746&amp;"> 2919_Jul12-Jan13.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>26.05 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508035610487816202/Letter_to_Ramsden_Family_Law_disclosure_07.06.2024.pdf?ex=6a2e711b&amp;is=6a2d1f9b&amp;hm=2791c1e5300954ca2366e08c173f89b09de9a78541b186869c504a56de1499dd&amp;"> Letter_to_Ramsden_Family_Law_disclosure_07.06.2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachmen