<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508065815789047969 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508065815789047969><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, May 24, 2026 3:15 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508065815789047969>5/24/2026 3:15 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Allegations of Bullying Conduct by Delaney Roberts in Family Law Proceedings 10/09/2024</strong>

Stephen Cooke expressed serious concerns regarding what he describes as ongoing bullying and adversarial conduct by Delaney Roberts throughout the Cooke family law proceedings. The correspondence outlines allegations of repeated delays, unnecessary legal escalation, excessive correspondence, mediation pressure despite incomplete disclosure, and attempts to intertwine parenting narratives with property settlement negotiations after settlement had been accepted in principle. Stephen further alleged that repeated references to emotional incidents involving the children were used in a manner designed to damage his relationship with them and distort perceptions of him as a parent. The material also details the significant financial strain caused by defending allegations, responding to shifting demands, engaging forensic accounting services, and prolonged litigation tactics, which Stephen asserts unnecessarily inflated costs and prolonged the matter.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508065816002695238/Urgent_Application_to_Limit_Costs_Addressing_Concerns.pdf?ex=6a2de47d&amp;is=6a2c92fd&amp;hm=c75dd5f37d92d2e62f838b556fc44dc1d45f5588ec68fd5647468c3713691e7d&amp;"> Urgent_Application_to_Limit_Costs_Addressing_Concerns.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>618.87 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508719528123695224 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508719528123695224><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, May 26, 2026 10:32 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508719528123695224>5/26/2026 10:32 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Self-Representation, Subpoena Requests &amp; Parenting Proceedings – Cooke Family Law Matter 10/10/2024</strong>

These documents primarily relate to Stephen Cooke’s transition into self-representation during ongoing family law proceedings shortly before a scheduled court mention in October 2024. The material focuses on correspondence between Stephen Cooke and Ramsden Family Law concerning subpoenas, parenting arrangements, family report preparation, and procedural filings. A major issue throughout the attachments is Stephen’s attempt to have drug and alcohol testing formally recognised within proceedings through subpoenas to Chromis Occupational Medicine, following concerns that prior evidence had not been adequately advanced. The documents also record Stephen’s request to formally pursue a 50/50 parenting arrangement, concerns regarding escalating legal costs and delays, and his growing belief that he needed to personally manage the matter to ensure his position and evidence were properly represented before the Court. The attachments further include Notices of Ceasing to Act, updated service details, draft subpoenas, and supporting medical and hair follicle testing records intended to address allegations surrounding alcohol use and parenting capacity.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719528610369626/EMAIL_-_Self-Representation_Subpoena_Requests__Parenting_Proceedings_Cooke_Family_Law_Matter.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=a2684dfe6e6379b9c90d2641dfd504669092c9cbb66ae2a9d91131f73b5b93b0&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Self-Representation_Subpoena_Requests__Parenting_Proceedings_Cooke_Family_Law_Matter.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>595.23 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719528895447070/Exhibit_A.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=c126448ba59962ada1957e0b0985326eed3938c02b6bb4d153ce392c43078d0e&amp;"> Exhibit_A.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.48 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719529155625010/DRAFT_Notice_of_ceasing_to_act.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=d15e70ea79db1717a5b39295c48e9f5bc083a8d823970b89c7a21269787ccd97&amp;"> DRAFT_Notice_of_ceasing_to_act.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>108.1 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719529411350638/Notice_of_ceasing_to_act_11.10.2024.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=6f95993440321f66b30f8ba0b54f6f95233db44f25938252001c3b549a7cef03&amp;"> Notice_of_ceasing_to_act_11.10.2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>115.56 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719529675587594/DRAFT_Subpoena_-_Chromis_Occupational_Medicine.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=8ec5495a2e04183766e8507b7a81a4749253d682c16654e3003e2f994e23c3e9&amp;"> DRAFT_Subpoena_-_Chromis_Occupational_Medicine.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>228.25 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719529927377028/without_prejudice_Parenting_Orders_offer.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=af344afc263254158850bb15bf228d1dfc7b114086ec0aae8575a8e064a220d4&amp;"> without_prejudice_Parenting_Orders_offer.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>518.45 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719530170388540/DRAFT_Notice_of_address_for_service_11.10.2024.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=eef8dd42603420557d75bad8e51eb7db030846a6a236edc9c410c0a77e2071ec&amp;"> DRAFT_Notice_of_address_for_service_11.10.2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>280.8 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508719530619437076/Drug_and_Alcohol_-_Stephen_Cooke.pdf?ex=6a2e4b0e&amp;is=6a2cf98e&amp;hm=c8b5da5e04fa8f2a0752e742217d0d3f8c284508885468ee22dd62bd5b2e8cbc&amp;"> Drug_and_Alcohol_-_Stephen_Cooke.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>11.3 MB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508721523756761119 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508721523756761119><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, May 26, 2026 10:40 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508721523756761119>5/26/2026 10:40 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Filtered Evidence &amp; Constrained Input — Shaping of the Family Report - 06/11/2024</strong>

This material captures the development of the joint letter of instruction to the Single Expert in Cooke &amp; Cooke (NCC3896/2023), highlighting a core issue of constrained participation and selective inclusion of evidence. The Applicant Father actively sought to contribute by providing additional documents and requesting confirmation that all relevant subpoenaed materials would be included to ensure a complete and transparent evidentiary base.

In response, the Respondent Mother’s solicitors amended the draft letter by removing documents proposed by the Applicant, citing procedural grounds and relevance limitations, particularly excluding materials linked to property or rejected filings.

While the process maintained a formal structure requiring all parties to be copied and the expert to act independently, the practical control over which documents were included in the instruction set remained solicitor-led.

Overall, the documents reflect a process where the Applicant engages in good faith to ensure completeness, yet the final evidentiary scope presented to the expert is filtered, reinforcing the central tension between participation and control.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508721523807227964/06.11.24_Draft_Joint_Letter_of_Instruction_to_Drew_Cowen_-_Family_Report.pdf?ex=6a2e4ce9&amp;is=6a2cfb69&amp;hm=e8113fcb3e7472ee06de8516b5bce4cb9f476e20e3a50f567e67e3ea187ae29b&amp;"> 06.11.24_Draft_Joint_Letter_of_Instruction_to_Drew_Cowen_-_Family_Report.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>673.11 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508721524075401338/Filtered_Evidence__Constrained_Input_Shaping_of_the_Family_Report.pdf?ex=6a2e4cea&amp;is=6a2cfb6a&amp;hm=c6cc49ee06a008d2213d9af052bd688c5a6a10145c7d7e3606a6470f6e47e223&amp;"> Filtered_Evidence__Constrained_Input_Shaping_of_the_Family_Report.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>917.89 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508725694744498306 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508725694744498306><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, May 26, 2026 10:57 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508725694744498306>5/26/2026 10:57 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"> Evidence, Control &amp; Turning Point – Litigation Shift and Self-Representation 10/10/2024</strong>

This material captures a critical escalation phase in October 2024 within the Cooke &amp; Cooke proceedings, where disputes over evidence, legal strategy, and costs converge. Central issues include the Applicant’s request to issue a subpoena for drug and alcohol testing records to formally place exculpatory evidence before the Court, contrasted with legal advice suggesting alternative, less costly approaches. Simultaneously, concerns arise regarding the selection and limitation of documents provided to the Single Expert, raising questions about control of the narrative influencing the family report. The Applicant formally shifts position to seek a 50/50 parenting arrangement and expresses urgency in filing an Amended Initiating Application. Increasing frustration with delays, costs, and perceived filtering of instructions by legal representatives leads to a breakdown in confidence and the initiation of self-representation. The documents collectively reflect mounting procedural complexity, financial strain, and a decisive transition in litigation approach.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508725694782509116/Email_-_Urgent_Family_Court_Escalation__Self-Representation_Decision.pdf?ex=6a2e50cc&amp;is=6a2cff4c&amp;hm=84a2309045634f54a478b2378ee73071e4aac93d44dff6a36957e7d90b6e3298&amp;"> Email_-_Urgent_Family_Court_Escalation__Self-Representation_Decision.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>603.7 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1508730597021978634 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1508730597021978634><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, May 26, 2026 11:16 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1508730597021978634>5/26/2026 11:16 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Formal Request to Limit Legal Costs – Financial Pressure &amp; Strategy to Contain Proceedings - 10/09/2024</strong>

This correspondence records the Applicant Father’s formal request to his legal representative to file an application to limit legal costs within the Cooke &amp; Cooke proceedings. The Applicant expresses concern about escalating expenses and the financial strain caused by ongoing legal activity, emphasising the need to preserve resources and avoid unnecessary expenditure.

The request is made in the context of upcoming Family Dispute Resolution Conferences scheduled for mid-September 2024, where the Court had required submission of case outlines and proposed orders. The Applicant seeks to shift the approach toward efficiency, focusing only on essential steps required to progress the matter toward resolution.

In addition, the Applicant raises concerns about procedural fairness and scope, including whether agreement to property settlement was being linked to acceptance of disputed parenting narratives, and whether contested material could still be advanced to the Court despite disagreement between parties. He also requests reasonable timeframes to respond to evolving requirements and signals the possibility of self-representation if costs continue to escalate.

Overall, this document reflects (1) early recognition of unsustainable legal costs, (2) a proactive attempt to formally limit further expenditure, and (3) concern about the intersection of procedural steps, deadlines, and disputed factual narratives within the broader proceedings.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1508730597055664179/Email_-_Formal_Request_to_Limit_Legal_Costs_Financial_Pressure__Strategy_to_Contain_Proceedings.pdf?ex=6a2e555d&amp;is=6a2d03dd&amp;hm=56a51cecb4facc1606a6bea688bc13840fdf402ce38e2b58f70608a76ce77c6a&amp;"> Email_-_Formal_Request_to_Limit_Legal_Costs_Financial_Pressure__Strategy_to_Contain_Proceedings.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>618.14 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1509448221473374280 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1509448221473374280><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 28, 2026 10:48 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1509448221473374280>5/28/2026 10:48 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Diamond IT Internship Collapse Amid Self-Representation &amp; Financial Loss –  29/05/2024</strong>

During 2024, Stephen Cooke entered into a recruitment and internship pathway with Diamond IT after being directly approached regarding a Tier 1 Support Analyst opportunity. Following interviews and technical discussions with senior staff, Stephen commenced a three-month unpaid internship on 8 July 2024, structured as an educational pathway toward full-time employment upon completion of certification milestones including CompTIA Network+, MS-102, and AZ-800. The arrangement required approximately 35 hours per week and was presented as practical industry training intended to transition into paid employment.

However, escalating Federal Circuit and Family Court proceedings forced Stephen into the position of self-representing himself within highly complex legal matters, making continuation of the internship practically impossible. The mounting legal pressures, administrative burden, and surrounding instability ultimately forced Stephen to abscond from the arrangement entirely, resulting in significant financial loss, disruption to career progression, and the collapse of a pathway that had originally been positioned as a transition back into stable employment. Over time, it also became apparent to Stephen that the internship environment and surrounding circumstances had become intertwined with broader patterns of pressure, destabilization, and coordinated attacks occurring across multiple areas of his life during the same period. Despite the breakdown of the arrangement, documented correspondence demonstrates Diamond IT’s strong initial interest and active efforts to recruit Stephen into the organization.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448219262713966/EMAIL_-_Diamond_IT_Internship_Collapse_Amid_Self-Representation__Financial_Loss.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb3&amp;is=6a2cfd33&amp;hm=c78689e54d15cab09a53bd571d463288133388aecf377b6ac4e7a01292b1257a&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Diamond_IT_Internship_Collapse_Amid_Self-Representation__Financial_Loss.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>932.88 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448219573227570/Stephen_Cooke_Cover_Letter_30_05_2024.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb3&amp;is=6a2cfd33&amp;hm=e470e11829622873d2a545aa763a54f968c3aeb333b575cfe0393fcb0de647c5&amp;"> Stephen_Cooke_Cover_Letter_30_05_2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>120.81 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448219841532024/Stephen_Cooke_Resume_30_05_2024.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb3&amp;is=6a2cfd33&amp;hm=3e8956f828b6f2700da3feef8dd2eac8bdeaa9b2afa2a85ec3ab605b47d78490&amp;"> Stephen_Cooke_Resume_30_05_2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>473.44 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448220143517746/Diamon_IT_Internship.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb3&amp;is=6a2cfd33&amp;hm=325d28a367a936eb40203ebae3431f67cbc6addcbd7e54f125a19cf735703fa0&amp;"> Diamon_IT_Internship.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>509.49 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448220517072946/Diamond_IT_Introduction.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb3&amp;is=6a2cfd33&amp;hm=070cee8ccf31666276536963e136f4b3a863d49e7ecc9ca59a4be9a6136719e9&amp;"> Diamond_IT_Introduction.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>29.13 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448220940566719/EMAIL_-_Signed_Internship_Agreement_Stephen_Cooke.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb4&amp;is=6a2cfd34&amp;hm=66b77e645631942df5e62638d93a409723b0720fb80f4b873b2a8c9ec643b485&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Signed_Internship_Agreement_Stephen_Cooke.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>308.68 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509448221230108702/Signed_Internship_Agreement_Stephen_Cooke.docx.pdf?ex=6a2e4eb4&amp;is=6a2cfd34&amp;hm=c1eb4977bb2b24217d64d7c37ab8bfa1653f0babcd2bd2ab81625a5f72633749&amp;"> Signed_Internship_Agreement_Stephen_Cooke.docx.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>458.67 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1509457047832231936 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1509457047832231936><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 28, 2026 11:23 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1509457047832231936>5/28/2026 11:23 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Concerns Regarding BMW Inspection Interaction, Diamond IT Associations &amp; Family Law Context - 13/10/2024</strong>

This material documents concerns raised by Stephen Cooke regarding a series of interactions occurring during his internship period at Diamond IT in October 2024, against the backdrop of ongoing Family Law proceedings, escalating legal costs, and significant emotional stress. The screenshots include Signal conversations between Stephen, his brother David Cooke, and sister Angela Cooke, as well as communications with a Diamond IT colleague known as “Technomancer” (Byron Makoney.) Stephen describes Technomancer rapidly developing familiarity with him before requesting transport assistance to inspect a used 2007 BMW being sold by an individual identified as Zachary (“Zac”). During the interaction, Stephen became aware that Technomancer had previously lost his licence due to drink driving and was unexpectedly asked to test drive the vehicle on his behalf. The messages and mechanic inspection report show Stephen repeatedly expressing caution regarding steering issues, repair costs, warning lights, and the overall financial risk of the vehicle. Following later discoveries concerning Zachary’s broader associations, Stephen developed concerns that the interaction may not have been entirely routine and could have intersected with anxieties surrounding his Family Law matter and other unusual social experiences occurring at the time.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457045810712586/Concerns_Regarding_BMW_Inspection_Interaction_Diamond_IT_Associations__Family_Law_Context.pdf?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=929d191ac16eab76a35319b8695a1e44f09bf7f17129ee3305de6a5de66fd67b&amp;"> Concerns_Regarding_BMW_Inspection_Interaction_Diamond_IT_Associations__Family_Law_Context.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>34.13 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457046179942430/Byron_Makoney_Diamond_IT_Messages.pdf?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=442857ccaafa6d9984dfbfbf351ea4350b7c00aac8d250569e1d876b694e938e&amp;"> Byron_Makoney_Diamond_IT_Messages.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>7.42 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457046553231410/Technomancer.png?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=e1eadb2db16468e50e750139db55bc0292bc0a493c3227976818556fb86d95cf&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457046553231410/Technomancer.png?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=e1eadb2db16468e50e750139db55bc0292bc0a493c3227976818556fb86d95cf&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Technomancer.png (157.42 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457047165341756/Screenshot_20260526_110821_Signal.jpg?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=6ec501e04b50b8f3ff452ea86614118b9f56e67fe5e8a8f277d50f6e550aa0a3&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457047165341756/Screenshot_20260526_110821_Signal.jpg?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=6ec501e04b50b8f3ff452ea86614118b9f56e67fe5e8a8f277d50f6e550aa0a3&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260526_110821_Signal.jpg (861.38 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457047538896926/Screenshot_20260526_110717_Signal.jpg?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=57a6411b421986ab3ed761ba0c6622df82e7b69fece05ec60193870e0720bd56&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509457047538896926/Screenshot_20260526_110717_Signal.jpg?ex=6a2e56ec&amp;is=6a2d056c&amp;hm=57a6411b421986ab3ed761ba0c6622df82e7b69fece05ec60193870e0720bd56&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Screenshot_20260526_110717_Signal.jpg (592.91 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1509462715918319667 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1509462715918319667><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 28, 2026 11:45 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1509462715918319667>5/28/2026 11:45 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Public Post and Private Messaging Interaction Wayne Tso (Neighbor (7A Bakeri Cct, Warabrook NSW 2304, Australia) and member of Hunter Bible Church (10 Reserved Rd, Garden Suburb NSW 2289, Australia)) - 08/05/2026</strong>

A public Facebook post by Wayne Tso states that Jesus is against the objectification of people. In response, Stephen Cooke comments, “Where are the children?” and then asks about the previous occupants of a specific address in Warabrook, NSW, indicating concern or suspicion related to people and a location.

In the private Messenger conversation, Wayne reaches out multiple times over several months, checking in casually and at one point apologizing in case he has hurt Stephen, expressing humility and his reliance on Jesus. He also shares a casual remark comparing someone to “Josh grown up” and sends a YouTube link.

In the most recent exchange, Wayne asks if Stephen has been able to contact his sons, noting he hasn’t heard from them in a long time since they returned to collect belongings.

Notably, the sequence of events suggests a perceived pattern: Wayne first makes a public religious statement, then later engages privately while toggling disappearing messages on and off. From Stephen’s perspective, this may appear as an attempt to provoke or “bait” a response while managing message visibility, though this interpretation is subjective rather than confirmed.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462713812779098/Wayne_Tso_Messages.pdf?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=703ff976df8d4315cf1a6e1f5b72a4046de5db3ed150aea7c77d7d98988a623b&amp;"> Wayne_Tso_Messages.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>19.04 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462714240471070/FB_IMG_1778672993606.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=7d55fdb7545c9402869c797682851f9925ffae47b7bb2255aad511cd6f264a7a&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462714240471070/FB_IMG_1778672993606.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=7d55fdb7545c9402869c797682851f9925ffae47b7bb2255aad511cd6f264a7a&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: FB_IMG_1778672993606.jpg (48.84 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462714722943057/FB_IMG_1778672999225.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=6586506c08fa0a342d91014c20cdd8e5d349c237b4c0fc5e55f824e04a6ac44c&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462714722943057/FB_IMG_1778672999225.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=6586506c08fa0a342d91014c20cdd8e5d349c237b4c0fc5e55f824e04a6ac44c&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: FB_IMG_1778672999225.jpg (74.36 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462715200962630/FB_IMG_1778673003610.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=3fec4960a7abcd81e09a545fae4fb465aa00f3257194ac7fb0cb13f893a2044f&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462715200962630/FB_IMG_1778673003610.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=3fec4960a7abcd81e09a545fae4fb465aa00f3257194ac7fb0cb13f893a2044f&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: FB_IMG_1778673003610.jpg (87.22 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462715591168070/FB_IMG_1778673007223.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=7afa3625fd42578a45cf851044e776951e9df278ff60831095277bfe27b5d3cd&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509462715591168070/FB_IMG_1778673007223.jpg?ex=6a2e5c33&amp;is=6a2d0ab3&amp;hm=7afa3625fd42578a45cf851044e776951e9df278ff60831095277bfe27b5d3cd&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: FB_IMG_1778673007223.jpg (8.83 KB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1509500116585681039 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1509500116585681039><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, May 28, 2026 2:14 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1509500116585681039>5/28/2026 2:14 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Consular Welfare Check, Community Correspondence, and Continued International Travel – Assertion of Autonomy — 02/04/2025–14/05/2025</strong>

The materials collectively document a sequence of events occurring between April and May 2025 concerning an international welfare check, subsequent overseas travel, and ongoing community correspondence relating to personal wellbeing.

On 2 April 2025, the Australian Embassy in Bangkok contacted Stephen Cooke after being advised by NSW Police that he was believed to be located in Thailand and that concerns had been raised regarding his welfare. The Embassy’s communication followed standard consular welfare-check procedures and was based on information provided by NSW Police.

It is asserted that there were no lawful or factual grounds necessitating such a welfare intervention at that time. Stephen Cooke was unemployed and therefore not subject to employment-related travel restrictions, and he remained legally entitled to travel internationally. The overseas travel also occurred in circumstances where existing parenting and custody arrangements had already been disrupted and discontinued by his former wife, removing any practical parenting obligation that would have restricted international movement.

The welfare escalation occurred shortly after a hospital discharge in which Stephen Cooke had been assessed as being of sound state of mind, with no findings of incapacity, impairment, or legal limitation affecting his autonomy or decision-making capacity. During this same period, Wayne Tso, identified as a neighbour residing across the street and associated with both a church community and the surgical department of John Hunter Hospital, is alleged to have involved himself in the situation in a manner perceived as undermining personal agency during a vulnerable period.

On 11 April 2025, Stephen Cooke confirmed directly to the Australian Embassy that he was safe, well, and did not require consular or medical assistance. The Embassy acknowledged this response the same day and confirmed that no further action was required, while advising that support remained available should circumstances change.

The documents further show that lawful international travel continued following the resolution of the welfare inquiry. On 14 April 2025, Thai Airways issued a confirmed boarding pass for flight TG682 from Bangkok to Tokyo, evidencing compliance with international travel requirements and the continued lawful exercise of freedom of movement. It is noted that this onward travel was undertaken deliberately to reassert personal autonomy and to challenge what was perceived as administrative and institutional overreach in circumstances where no legal orders, medical findings, or lawful restrictions existed limiting movement.

Additional community correspondence from May 2025 provides further context regarding ongoing welfare-related communications. Screenshots show messages from Joshua Davidson, a member of Hunter Bible Church who had regularly visited Stephen Cooke and his children weekly at 7A Bakeri Circuit, Warabrook NSW 2304. The messages are framed as friendly and informal welfare check-ins, expressing concern for their wellbeing and asking whether they remained overseas or had returned to Australia.

In summary, the materials collectively demonstrate that an international welfare check was initiated following lawful overseas travel despite the absence of medical findings or legal restrictions affecting autonomy. The matter was resolved once safety and wellbeing were confirmed directly with the Australian Embassy. The subsequent continuation of international travel, together with later community welfare correspondence, is presented as evidence of an ongoing effort to reassert lawful personal agency, maintain freedom of movement, and bring closure to the matter.</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509500113502998588/EMAIL_-_Australian_Embassy_in_Bangkok.pdf?ex=6a2dd648&amp;is=6a2c84c8&amp;hm=e19e6debf8a152008ce2b39e24670a0e0158e6bb31863d01297db40ed322faaf&amp;"> EMAIL_-_Australian_Embassy_in_Bangkok.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>1.03 MB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509500113838669974/Hospital_list_August_2024.pdf?ex=6a2dd648&amp;is=6a2c84c8&amp;hm=f24ebdb615859685613e2212cefeb2b192513e22f5f37252729469dc13941162&amp;"> Hospital_list_August_2024.pdf </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>799.19 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1466356241738760202/1509500114203316344/BoardingPass.pdf?ex=6a2dd648&amp;is=6a2c84c8&amp;hm=6e3b